  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* feat(smc86): expand modern Intel SMC key coverage + add keys/info subcmds by @hjh1990 in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/71\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.3 to 7.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/65\n* docs(changelog): set v0.4.3 release date by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/72\n* fix(cli): reject unknown flags and rename monitor --metrics to --metric by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/70\n* build(deps): bump actions/upload-pages-artifact from 3.0.1 to 5.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/66\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-node from 4.1.0 to 6.4.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/67\n* build(deps): bump softprops/action-gh-release from 3.0.0 to 3.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/68\n* build(deps): bump actions/configure-pages from 5.0.0 to 6.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/69\n* docs: document org-level defaults and ljh-sh-default-main ruleset by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/74\n* docs: move org-level governance notes to mneme AGENTS.md by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/77\n* feat(battery): expose all IOKit battery fields and add detailed docs by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/78\n* chore(release): add v0.5.0 changelog by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/79\n\n## New Contributors\n* @hjh1990 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/pull/71\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ljh-sh/macli/compare/v0.4.3...v0.5.0",
